{sov: Notes}
Heavy Metal Landmark: Anchored by Tony Iommi's iconic power-chord riff in
B minor / B Pentatonic, matched in unison by the bass line.

Riff Execution: The signature ornament in the second bar involves fast
hammer-on and pull-off grace-note slides between G5, F#5, and G5 before
resolving back down to E5.

Verse Feel: The vocals mirror the main heavy guitar riff directly throughout
the verse sections.

Solo Section: The solo speeds up to an uptempo, driving rock beat over a static
B5 power chord vamp using B minor pentatonic and blues scales.
{eov}